[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186059675 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/id #uuid "d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/math-academy-id "q-167314" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}\\,=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We know that \n\n$$\n\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,\\,\\,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nApplying these formulae and the constant multiple rules, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+3(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/id #uuid "a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer/id #uuid "7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\cos x-3\\sin x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186059677 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/id #uuid "3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/math-academy-id "q-167315" :question/problem "${f}^{″}(x)=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "In part 2, we found that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the second derivative, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-3(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer/id #uuid "cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\sin x-3\\cos x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096619 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/id #uuid "23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/math-academy-id "q-167316" :question/problem "If a curve $C$ is defined by the equation $y=x\\cdot f(x),$ calculate the slope of the tangent line to the curve at the point where $x=0.$\n\nSlope $\\,=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate using the product rule. \n\nIn part 2 we found that $\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\nApplying the product rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}+f\\frac{\\text{d}(x)}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =x\\cdot (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =(2-3x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+(3+2x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the slope of the tangent line, we now substitute $x=0$ into the formula and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & =(2-3(0))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)+(3+2(0))\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/id #uuid "59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer/id #uuid "2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186092240 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/id #uuid "83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/math-academy-id "q-167317" :question/problem "The equation of the normal to the curve $y=x\\cdot f(x)$ at the point where $x=0$ is$\\,y=$\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "When $x=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =0\\cdot f(0)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn part 3, we found that the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=x\\cdot f(x)$ at the point where $x=0$ is $m=3.$ Therefore, the slope of the normal ${m}^{′}$ is\n\n$$\n{m}^{′}=-\\frac{1}{m}=-\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the equation of the normal line is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & ={m}^{′}(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-0 & =-\\frac{1}{3}(x-0) \\\\ y & =-\\frac{x}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/id #uuid "18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer/id #uuid "f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096621 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/id #uuid "7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-167318" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})\\,=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that $f(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\nWe apply the quotient rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}) & =\\frac{{f}^{′}(x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-f(x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{′}}{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)^{′}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{′}}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x-(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-3{sin}^{2}⁡x\\cancel{-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}-3{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer/id #uuid "c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sin^2 x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186092263 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/id #uuid "69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-167319" :question/problem "Given that $y=h(g(x)),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=(${{field-1}}$){e}^{4{x}^{2}+8x+2}$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $y$ is a composite function:\n\n$$\ny={e}^{s},\\,s=2g=2(2{x}^{2}+4x+1)=4{x}^{2}+8x+2.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s}={e}^{s},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}x}=8x+8.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={e}^{s}\\cdot (8x+8) \\\\  & =(8x+8)\\,{e}^{4{x}^{2}+8x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer/id #uuid "7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8x+8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064178 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/id #uuid "10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-167321" :question/problem "$\\int f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\,=${{field-1}}\n$+\\,C,\\,$ where $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C,\\,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+3\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/id #uuid "dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer/id #uuid "39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\cos x+3\\sin x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064177 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/id #uuid "3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/math-academy-id "q-167322" :question/problem "$\\int (g(x)+\\sqrt{h(x)})\\,\\text{d}x\\,=${{field-1}}\n$+\\,C,\\,$ where $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/worked-solution "We combine the sum and the constant multiple rules, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (g(x)+\\sqrt{h(x)})\\text{d}x & =\\int (2{x}^{2}+4x+1+\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2{x}^{2}+4x+1+{e}^{x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+4\\int x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\,\\text{d}x+\\int {e}^{x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+4\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+x+{e}^{x}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{3}}{3}+2{x}^{2}+x+{e}^{x}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/id #uuid "94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer/id #uuid "377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}x^3+2x^2+x+e^x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "multistep-28c2b9d3-d453-55d6-bb8e-a0699c2d9716" :multistep/id #uuid "28c2b9d3-d453-55d6-bb8e-a0699c2d9716" :multistep/context "Consider the following functions: \n\n$$\nf(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,\\,g(x)=2{x}^{2}+4x+1,\\,h(x)={e}^{2x}\n$$" :multistep/steps ["step-c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4" "step-124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72" "step-42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce" "step-cb888f8e-1980-5390-b613-3f7bcb184223" "step-020c7308-acef-5400-8e2c-98af9ad42797" "step-3812824f-bd17-5210-9b87-970bdc2becba" "step-27371a72-43e3-590d-9f7d-4ebb3d401d7d" "step-d6987879-3ac4-57c0-ace4-91b86818a2c0"] :multistep/first-step "step-c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4" :db/ensure [:multistep/validate]} {:db/id "step-c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4" :step/id #uuid "c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4" :step/content "question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :step/next "step-124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72" :step/id #uuid "124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72" :step/content "question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :step/next "step-42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce" :step/id #uuid "42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce" :step/content "question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :step/next "step-cb888f8e-1980-5390-b613-3f7bcb184223" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-cb888f8e-1980-5390-b613-3f7bcb184223" :step/id #uuid "cb888f8e-1980-5390-b613-3f7bcb184223" :step/content "question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :step/next "step-020c7308-acef-5400-8e2c-98af9ad42797" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-020c7308-acef-5400-8e2c-98af9ad42797" :step/id #uuid "020c7308-acef-5400-8e2c-98af9ad42797" :step/content "question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :step/next "step-3812824f-bd17-5210-9b87-970bdc2becba" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-3812824f-bd17-5210-9b87-970bdc2becba" :step/id #uuid "3812824f-bd17-5210-9b87-970bdc2becba" :step/content "question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :step/next "step-27371a72-43e3-590d-9f7d-4ebb3d401d7d" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-27371a72-43e3-590d-9f7d-4ebb3d401d7d" :step/id #uuid "27371a72-43e3-590d-9f7d-4ebb3d401d7d" :step/content "question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :step/next "step-d6987879-3ac4-57c0-ace4-91b86818a2c0" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-d6987879-3ac4-57c0-ace4-91b86818a2c0" :step/id #uuid "d6987879-3ac4-57c0-ace4-91b86818a2c0" :step/content "question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "assigned-problem-e2a6537c-7bc9-5905-9f26-9c9377a1f012" :assigned-problem/id #uuid "e2a6537c-7bc9-5905-9f26-9c9377a1f012" :assigned-problem/content "multistep-28c2b9d3-d453-55d6-bb8e-a0699c2d9716" :assigned-problem/topic-coverage [17592186050420 17592186050902 17592186048813 17592186049119 17592186048842 17592186050271 17592186048777 17592186048754] :db/ensure [:assigned-problem/validate]} {:db/id "activity-48d1b748-84a6-5eec-80e5-27751f85ec47" :activity/id #uuid "48d1b748-84a6-5eec-80e5-27751f85ec47" :activity/title "Applying the Rules of Differentiation and Integration" :activity/type :activity.type/assignment :activity/steps ["step-ce68614c-f01d-5e87-a105-41e44854ad85"] :activity/first-step "step-ce68614c-f01d-5e87-a105-41e44854ad85" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-ce68614c-f01d-5e87-a105-41e44854ad85" :step/id #uuid "ce68614c-f01d-5e87-a105-41e44854ad85" :step/content "assigned-problem-e2a6537c-7bc9-5905-9f26-9c9377a1f012" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}] "assertions" [["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/id #uuid "d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09"] ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/math-academy-id "q-167314"] ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}\\,=${{field-1}}"] ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/worked-solution "We know that \n\n$$\n\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,\\,\\,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nApplying these formulae and the constant multiple rules, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+3(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/id #uuid "a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201"] ["answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer/id #uuid "7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767"] ["answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767" :answer/value "2\\cos x-3\\sin x"] ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/correct "answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767"] ["answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201" :answer-field/choices "answer-7e6909d1-d468-57ba-9c1d-3d5cb4227767"] ["question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-a57ea9e1-ed51-5d95-b830-65a1b8749201"] [17592186059675 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d6bef3aa-1e35-5c0b-9918-79c593520a09"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/id #uuid "3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/math-academy-id "q-167315"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/problem "${f}^{″}(x)=${{field-1}}"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/worked-solution "In part 2, we found that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the second derivative, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-3(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995"] ["answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer/id #uuid "cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b"] ["answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b" :answer/value "-2\\sin x-3\\cos x"] ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/correct "answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b"] ["answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995" :answer-field/choices "answer-cb3ec1d1-9fe2-5eca-aa8b-aabb7774712b"] ["question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-9f81e8b4-7cd2-5293-a098-28ef35309995"] [17592186059677 :knowledge-point/questions "question-3a1102d7-7580-50b4-ac10-6265fe1b7909"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/id #uuid "23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/math-academy-id "q-167316"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/problem "If a curve $C$ is defined by the equation $y=x\\cdot f(x),$ calculate the slope of the tangent line to the curve at the point where $x=0.$\n\nSlope $\\,=$\n{{field-1}}"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate using the product rule. \n\nIn part 2 we found that $\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\nApplying the product rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}+f\\frac{\\text{d}(x)}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =x\\cdot (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =(2-3x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+(3+2x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the slope of the tangent line, we now substitute $x=0$ into the formula and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & =(2-3(0))\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)+(3+2(0))\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line is $3.$"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/id #uuid "59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f"] ["answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer/id #uuid "2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46"] ["answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/correct "answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46"] ["answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f" :answer-field/choices "answer-2f296ed5-5ee1-5373-8853-cd9b42ca5b46"] ["question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-59299f55-f653-572d-af54-ffb8778f188f"] [17592186096619 :knowledge-point/questions "question-23f453dd-5391-598b-a2f5-caa9d74e0c57"] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/id #uuid "83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf"] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/math-academy-id "q-167317"] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/problem "The equation of the normal to the curve $y=x\\cdot f(x)$ at the point where $x=0$ is$\\,y=$\n{{field-1}}."] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/worked-solution "When $x=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =0\\cdot f(0)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn part 3, we found that the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=x\\cdot f(x)$ at the point where $x=0$ is $m=3.$ Therefore, the slope of the normal ${m}^{′}$ is\n\n$$\n{m}^{′}=-\\frac{1}{m}=-\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the equation of the normal line is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & ={m}^{′}(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-0 & =-\\frac{1}{3}(x-0) \\\\ y & =-\\frac{x}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/id #uuid "18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a"] ["answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer/id #uuid "f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574"] ["answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574" :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{3}"] ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/correct "answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574"] ["answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a" :answer-field/choices "answer-f0d57a8a-8cc2-5e2e-b732-91ab7b590574"] ["question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-18483c38-3053-519d-b88d-7489fff9750a"] [17592186092240 :knowledge-point/questions "question-83558817-3486-5c78-a29c-1e7dcf477ccf"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/id #uuid "7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-167318"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})\\,=${{field-1}}"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/worked-solution "Recall that $f(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\nWe apply the quotient rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}) & =\\frac{{f}^{′}(x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-f(x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{′}}{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)^{′}\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)^{′}}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x-(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}-3{sin}^{2}⁡x\\cancel{-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}-3{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3({sin}^{2}⁡x+{cos}^{2}⁡x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94"] ["answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer/id #uuid "c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294"] ["answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sin^2 x}"] ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/correct "answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294"] ["answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94" :answer-field/choices "answer-c712774a-c1bc-5ca0-b374-7906f054c294"] ["question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-4a3b451a-2a50-5d61-ab5a-17f181f52c94"] [17592186096621 :knowledge-point/questions "question-7a7e1449-9e66-5cab-bc6e-62dcc6353f1c"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/id #uuid "69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/math-academy-id "q-167319"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/problem "Given that $y=h(g(x)),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=(${{field-1}}$){e}^{4{x}^{2}+8x+2}$"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $y$ is a composite function:\n\n$$\ny={e}^{s},\\,s=2g=2(2{x}^{2}+4x+1)=4{x}^{2}+8x+2.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s}={e}^{s},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}x}=8x+8.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}s}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={e}^{s}\\cdot (8x+8) \\\\  & =(8x+8)\\,{e}^{4{x}^{2}+8x+2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5"] ["answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer/id #uuid "7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c"] ["answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c" :answer/value "8x+8"] ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/correct "answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c"] ["answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5" :answer-field/choices "answer-7a57be08-0dbd-57eb-baa9-7dbfa44d370c"] ["question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-75b9845e-ad7e-59d5-bd52-917623fb75e5"] [17592186092263 :knowledge-point/questions "question-69c70b64-ff8f-54e6-8fcc-bda6931079a9"] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/id #uuid "10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1"] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-167321"] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/problem "$\\int f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\,=${{field-1}}\n$+\\,C,\\,$ where $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C,\\,\\,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+3\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/id #uuid "dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f"] ["answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer/id #uuid "39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d"] ["answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d" :answer/value "-2\\cos x+3\\sin x"] ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/correct "answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d"] ["answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f" :answer-field/choices "answer-39b4e062-ad59-5766-a138-f351f333cf1d"] ["question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-dccf592a-07ff-571c-a6b2-42b304ad235f"] [17592186064178 :knowledge-point/questions "question-10fbc4f9-a999-51b3-a93e-6600a9db62f1"] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/id #uuid "3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041"] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/math-academy-id "q-167322"] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/problem "$\\int (g(x)+\\sqrt{h(x)})\\,\\text{d}x\\,=${{field-1}}\n$+\\,C,\\,$ where $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/worked-solution "We combine the sum and the constant multiple rules, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (g(x)+\\sqrt{h(x)})\\text{d}x & =\\int (2{x}^{2}+4x+1+\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (2{x}^{2}+4x+1+{e}^{x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+4\\int x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\,\\text{d}x+\\int {e}^{x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+4\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+x+{e}^{x}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{3}}{3}+2{x}^{2}+x+{e}^{x}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/id #uuid "94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf"] ["answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer/id #uuid "377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c"] ["answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}x^3+2x^2+x+e^x"] ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/correct "answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c"] ["answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf" :answer-field/choices "answer-377ccfc0-1263-5a65-9e54-437b028ff77c"] ["question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-94d042fc-7530-5277-b11d-323323c45edf"] [17592186064177 :knowledge-point/questions "question-3e81fa55-2e11-5d7c-adb0-c91b70ee1041"] ["multistep-28c2b9d3-d453-55d6-bb8e-a0699c2d9716" :multistep/id #uuid "28c2b9d3-d453-55d6-bb8e-a0699c2d9716"] ["step-c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4" :step/id #uuid "c052c336-6edd-5419-ae8e-3dd4264bdae4"] ["step-124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72" :step/id #uuid "124d17db-6167-5118-8e06-fed51b7f8b72"] ["step-42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce" :step/id #uuid "42c45601-1d60-5de7-b40b-37d953e3a8ce"] ["step-cb888f8e-1980-5390-b